Hello,

I have rebuilt the pre-built Blackfin toolchain generated by Buildroot
with C++ support disabled, and deployed it on autobuild.buildroot.net.
This should avoid a number of C++ related Blackfin build failures.

We will keep C++ support disabled for Blackfin in the internal
toolchain backend for 2016.08, and hopefully we'll have a fix for this
problem for the next release cycle.

